+/**
+ * @file rccl_wrap.cc
+ * @brief ROCm collective policy derived from each communicator's topology.
+ *
+ * Protocol thread limits and buffer sizes belong to the communicator being
+ * configured. Publish complete local defaults; process-global lazy arrays can
+ * expose a zero LL limit during concurrent initialization and retain another
+ * architecture's limits across independent communicator lifetimes.
+ */
